{"version":1,"content":"<p>車婉婉、徐榮等今天（14日）拍攝處境劇《愛‧回家之三代同糖》，車婉婉宣布《開心速遞》成員「三太」樊亦敏和「KC」歐瑞偉「回家」入劇組，樊亦敏將換上新角色「龔喜」，扮演其助手的歐瑞偉雖然身分有改變，但角色源用「KC」稱呼。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.364270+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T12:30:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T11:57:44.622958+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416480+00:00","content_hash":"e1f64dec70cebf49310326635975bb7209913517355b7067daedbfd7ec30a324","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}